    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Network of Teaching & Learning conducted third Teaching and Learning Enhancement Workshop for AKU Pakistan faculty in Karachi on October 11-13, 2017. The course was offered to 27 AKU East Africa faculty drawn from all the entities in Dar es Salaam on 25th - 27th July, 2016 and in Karachi on 28-30th September, 2016. The programme is approved by Academic Council in February 2016 and is mandatory course for faculty who have been employed in AKU for five years and less. Older and more experienced faculty are also eligible to attend as the format of the programme is flexible enough to accommodate faculty of varied experience levels.",
